{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/90cc83678fb1f6670c6d4e73edfc4e37.avif?t=1771425543\" width=1232 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw together on Discord!</strong> (Link in sidebar or scan QR above) \u2014 Share your art, exchange feedback, and help shape the game\u2019s future. Be the first to hear about updates, new modelpacks, and upcoming events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/74fc98883cdc2e463248f273ba24d8f4.avif?t=1771425543\" width=1232 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exquisite <strong>collection of 3D-scanned classical and renaissance sculptures to draw</strong> \u2014 curated to provide accurate anatomy, dynamic poses, and a variety of body types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/59ebc82e29e7093bb4ed74bcb52d5c6a.poster.avif?t=1771425543\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/59ebc82e29e7093bb4ed74bcb52d5c6a.webm?t=1771425543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/59ebc82e29e7093bb4ed74bcb52d5c6a.mp4?t=1771425543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/2e510d4c26abe9f287ff5f326ba8af3a.avif?t=1771425543\" width=1232 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your own <strong>infinite virtual garden</strong> of towering monuments, intricate fountains, and quiet courtyards \u2014 which <strong>expands as you draw</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/fdecbf598bd45f605fa97dd7985f2abe.poster.avif?t=1771425543\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/fdecbf598bd45f605fa97dd7985f2abe.webm?t=1771425543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/fdecbf598bd45f605fa97dd7985f2abe.mp4?t=1771425543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/05239d6bfb95d251867f580a903403af.avif?t=1771425543\" width=1232 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practicing your shading? Enter <strong>Dynamic Lighting </strong>mode and light the figure as you desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/b03869295f9f7d3e0e471807fcc6bfd2.poster.avif?t=1771425543\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/b03869295f9f7d3e0e471807fcc6bfd2.webm?t=1771425543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/b03869295f9f7d3e0e471807fcc6bfd2.mp4?t=1771425543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/647066ae92e1ea7d75a5b008810a5d21.avif?t=1771425543\" width=1232 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare <strong>Challenge Sculptures</strong>, which will introduce you to new techniques and help sharpen your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/4e9706ca2068a9e1fba9c30136033e8d.poster.avif?t=1771425543\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/4e9706ca2068a9e1fba9c30136033e8d.webm?t=1771425543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/4e9706ca2068a9e1fba9c30136033e8d.mp4?t=1771425543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/ad3e1c58efb7430871c36a7a5eb9f9e1.avif?t=1771425543\" width=1232 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to figure drawing? The <strong>Simplified Form </st